A. N/12 的算术来源
==========================================================================
  g(d)/d^2 -> 1/12 ?  [np.float64(0.083333334), np.float64(0.083333403), np.float64(0.083340279), np.float64(0.083507637)]
  g''(d)   -> 1/6  ?  [0.16666667, 0.166666944, 0.166694451, 0.167365271]
  => 1/12 是 g(d) 的二次系数（= -2log(2 sin(d/2)) 的高阶项），不是 zeta(2)/2=0.822467
  SU(2): min_u Phi''(u) = 0.166666508 at u=1.581e-05   (N/12 = 0.166666667)
  SU(2): ['t=0.001: min=0.166667', 't=0.05: min=0.166694', 't=0.3: min=0.167675', 't=1: min=0.178954']   (N/12=0.166667)
  SU(3): ['t=0.001: min=0.250000', 't=0.05: min=0.250010', 't=0.3: min=0.250376', 't=1: min=0.254268']   (N/12=0.250000)
  => min_lam min_v <v,Hess Phi v> = N/12，两因子 = (N/2)[A_{N-1} Laplacian] x (1/6)[g'']
